rm, hinted to be of extraterrestrial origin, has swept across humanity, transforming the vast majority of people into vicious undead mutants called the Ridden. A year after the catastrophe began, scattered pockets of humanity cling to survival amid the ruins. Standing against the tide are the Cleaners, a band of hardened veteran survivors who take the fight to the Ridden and defend Fort Hope, a fortified settlement in the fictional town of Finleyville, Pennsylvania. Players take control of one of these Cleaners, teaming up with others to battle through hordes of grotesque, mutated enemies across a series of campaign missions. Facing relentless swarms and ever-shifting dangers, the Cleaners must hold the line, rescue survivors, and push back against the parasite threatening to wipe out what remains of the world.", "summary": "Back 4 Blood: Ultimate Edition includes the base game, 4 character Battle Hardened Skin Pack, additional digital in-game items, and annual pass with three upcoming downloadable content drops and more.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/back-4-blood-ultimate-edition", "videos": [{"id": 44326, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "rok9-g8E0PE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rok9-g8E0PE", "title": "Back 4 Blood - Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rok9-g8E0PE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 44325, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "7RCgT-XOPr4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7RCgT-XOPr4", "title": "Back 4 Blood - Game Awards Gameplay Demo", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7RCgT-XOPr4/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}